    - target: {fileID: 7364205516402891153, guid: 6ac3376308d45044d9fddc0c6d58ff97, type: 3}
      propertyPath: intro.Array.data[0].Text
      value: 'New recruits report here. We start with the basics: one squad and one HQ.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7364205516402891153, guid: 6ac3376308d45044d9fddc0c6d58ff97, type: 3}
      propertyPath: intro.Array.data[1].Text
      value: I'll walk you through it. Press Start when you're ready.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7364205516402891153, guid: 6ac3376308d45044d9fddc0c6d58ff97, type: 3}
      propertyPath: outro.Array.data[0].Text
      value: Well done, recruit. You can move, buy and fight.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7364205516402891153, guid: 6ac3376308d45044d9fddc0c6d58ff97, type: 3}
      propertyPath: outro.Array.data[1].Text
      value: Next we stop walking everywhere. A new mission is on the map.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
